  <p>
    An interactive official FIVB indoor volleyball scoreboard and tactical rotation tracker designed for players, coaches, referees, and scorekeepers. Track rally scoring, set points, side-outs, clockwise player rotations, timeouts, and substitutions with precision and real-time visual feedback.
